---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import UrlBadge from "../components/UrlBadge.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { profilePage } from "../lib/jsonld";
import { getSpotifyTopTrack } from "../lib/spotify";

export const prerender = false;

const postCount = (await getCollection("posts")).length;
const track = await getSpotifyTopTrack();
---
<Layout jsonLd={profilePage}>
	<main class="post-content container mx-auto py-16 **:leading-7">
		<h1 class="mb-8 font-semibold text-2xl text-black dark:text-white">Nathan David</h1>
		<section><p>Hello <span class="inline-block hover:animate-wiggle">👋🏻</span> Je suis un développeur fullstack passioné par les automatisations, la performance et l'open-source.</p></section>
		<section class="mt-8"><p>Après un master informatique à <UrlBadge url="https://www.mewo.fr" title="Mewo" /> effectué en alternance chez <UrlBadge url="https://www.sesamm.com/" title="SESAMm" />, j'occupe désormais le poste de développeur fullstack depuis plus de 4 ans.</p></section>
		<section class="mt-8">
			<p>En parallèle, je réalise des projets personnels que je documente sur ce site. Vous pouvez retrouver mes <span class="font-semibold">{postCount} articles</span> sur la page <a class="text-primary underline decoration-dashed" href="/tag/all">blog</a>.</p>
			<p class="mt-2">Par exemple, j'essaie d'apprendre <UrlBadge url="https://www.rust-lang.org/" title="Rust" /> et <UrlBadge url="https://go.dev/" title="Go" />.</p>
		</section>
		<section class="mt-8">
			<p>En dehors de la programation, j'aime regarder des séries, <a class="text-primary underline decoration-dashed" href="https://www.kenmei.co/user/vahor?ref=vahor.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">lire</a> et écouter de la musique.</p>
			{track && (
				<div id="spotify-track" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 sm:mt-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
					<div class="hidden justify-end sm:flex">
						<img src="/currently-listening.svg" alt="En ce moment j'écoute:" width="294" height="94" class="dark:invert" />
					</div>
					<div class="font-semibold sm:hidden"><p>En ce moment j'écoute:</p></div>
					<a href={track.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex min-h-20 flex-row gap-4 rounded-md border bg-card p-2 text-card-foreground">
						<img src={track.image} alt={track.album} width="64" height="64" class="inline-block h-16 w-16 rounded-lg" />
						<div>
							<div class="font-semibold">{track.name}</div>
							<div class="text-neutral-700 text-sm dark:text-neutral-300">{track.artists}</div>
						</div>
					</a>
				</div>
			)}
		</section>
		<section class="mt-8">
			<p>Vous pouvez me retrouver sur <UrlBadge url="https://github.com/vahor" title="GitHub" favicon="/icons/github-mark.svg" darkFavicon="/icons/github-mark-white.svg" /> <UrlBadge url="https://discordapp.com/users/132552926689230848" title="Discord" alt="Discord icon" favicon="/icons/discord.svg" />, <UrlBadge url="https://twitter.com/vahor_" title="Twitter" alt="Twitter icon" favicon="/icons/twitter.svg" />.</p>
			<p class="mt-2">Ou me contacter par mail: <button type="button" data-copy="me@vahor.fr" title="Copier l’adresse e-mail" class="inline w-max cursor-pointer space-x-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md border border-neutral-200 bg-card p-1 text-accent-foreground text-sm leading-4 hover:border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700"><Icon name="send" class="inline-block size-4" /><span>me@vahor.fr</span></button><span data-copy-status role="status" class="ml-2 text-sm"></span></p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
